    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d376">

                <pb facs="0446" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg386"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wetter to Mr. Strobel</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tamatave</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 7.]</seg></opener>
                <p>I regret to say that the report here is prevalent that Mr. Waller absconded.”
                    This I will state: I find he has appointed himself administrator of Crockett’s
                    estate and taken over the entire assets of said estate and carried them with
                    him. As soon as I can I will report in a separate dispatch on this subject.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
